<title>USA: Urban Shopping completes shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Urban Shopping completes shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Shopping Centers Inc said Monday it completed a three million share shelf offering, raising net proceeds of $75 million before giving effect to a 300,000 share overallotment exercise.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds after deducting transaction costs, which are expected to be minimal, will be used to fund a portion of the recently announced acquisition of Old Orchard Shopping Center, a 1.7 million square foot regional shopping center in suburban Chicago.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
